* **Action:** The clinician logs onto the dashboard and inputs the patient's quantitative biometric markers (e.g., Blood Pressure, Serum Cholesterol, Oldpeak ST-segment profiles) into the React view interface (`App.jsx`).
* **Trigger:** Clicking **"Execute Diagnostics Pipeline"** validates and locks the form fields.
